      glyph centre at x=352. A 48dp touch target - the platform minimum, and what
      the trailing slot needs to be tappable at all - with its right edge on the
      same 16 margin puts that centre at 350. Two dp, against a wrapper that is
      slack by construction and against HOME and ABOUT US, which put their own
      trailing action flush on the margin.
    -->
    <dimen name="collection_header_action_size">48dp</dimen>

